Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed1::
	.string "MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}! Guess who's not\n"
	.string "mad at you anymore?\p"
	.string "Go get JUAN's BADGE. I'll be cheering\n"
	.string "for you!$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed2::
	.string "MAY: Eight BADGES! That's all of\n"
	.string "them!\p"
	.string "The POKéMON LEAGUE is in\n"
	.string "EVER GRANDE CITY.\p"
	.string "It's east of SOOTOPOLIS. Climb the\n"
	.string "waterfall there, then go through\l"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "You can do it!$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed3::
	.string "MAY: CHAMPION {PLAYER}! Everyone in\n"
	.string "HOENN knows your name now.\p"
	.string "Whatever's going on with the sky, I\n"
	.string "know you'll handle it.\p"
	.string "Then come by the LAB. BRENDAN and I\n"
	.string "want a rematch!$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed1::
	.string "BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}. …So, uh. Go\n"
	.string "beat JUAN.\p"
	.string "If you lose to him after all that,\n"
	.string "I'm never letting you hear the end\l"
	.string "of it.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed2::
	.string "BRENDAN: All eight BADGES, huh?\n"
	.string "Figures.\p"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD starts past the\n"
	.string "waterfall in EVER GRANDE CITY.\p"
	.string "The trainers in there are no joke.\n"
	.string "Don't lose before you reach the\l"
	.string "LEAGUE!$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed3::
	.string "BRENDAN: CHAMPION, huh? …Man,\n"
	.string "you're strong.\p"
	.string "Once things calm down, come by my\n"
	.string "dad's LAB.\p"
	.string "MAY and I have a rematch waiting\n"
	.string "for you.$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed1::
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}! I heard about\n"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS.\p"
	.string "…I'm sorry for everything I said. I\n"
	.string "didn't know.\p"
	.string "I'll be waiting at VICTORY ROAD.\n"
	.string "Let's have a real battle this time!$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed2::
	.string "WALLY: You're too strong, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I'm going to keep training with\n"
	.string "GALLADE. Someday I'll catch up to\l"
	.string "you!$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed3::
	.string "WALLY: CHAMPION {PLAYER}! My uncle\n"
	.string "can't stop talking about it.\p"
	.string "He says he always knew. …He didn't,\n"
	.string "but that's okay.$"
